commit.message:
fix(post): bound the EDM condition table, every refusal by id and key

Review of PR #560:
- gap > 0; on a wire, gap < the wire's radius when both are stated;
- wire_diameter and undersize in (0, 1] mm, judged after unit scaling;
- the parse takes the declared kind: undersize refuses on a wire and
  wire_diameter on a sinker;
- a condition's wire must be one of the machine's edm.wire_diameters
  (within 0.001 mm) when it states any;
- ids: no surrounding spaces, numeric ids whole numbers only, unique
  ignoring case and leading zeros;
- an unknown condition key refuses by name; lengths finite after scaling;
- one rule function (condition_refusal) serves the reader and is_sane;
- conditions[] documented in assets/machines/AGENTS.md; the parser tests
  move to crates/post/src/machine/edm_conditions_tests.rs (the app suite
  keeps the project round trip).

Refs #531

